{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口获取经过一定条件过滤后的客户下创意素材库对应的视频及视频信息。为保证接口使用的安全性，避免调取他人的图片信息，该接口针对素材URL的字段仅查询自己主体下的素材才会返回。对素材视频进行过滤的时候， `video_ids`、 `material_ids`、 `signatures`只能选择一个进行过滤。获取视频素材数据量在100w以内时支持全量获取。关键配合接口如【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"ad.file_video.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/video/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710601820172\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710601820172\",\"title\":\"获取视频素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XVLXUIvN\">通过此接口，用户可以获取经过一定条件过滤后的客户下创意素材库对应的视频及视频信息。</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xojwq%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-Z7Ze9MLM%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-lThFLe7e%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%BA%E4%BF%9D%E8%AF%81%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E8%B0%83%E5%8F%96%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90URL%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E4%BB%85%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E9%9C%80%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%9C%80%E4%B8%8EAPPID%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%88%B0%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%84%E8%A7%88URL%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E4%BC%9A%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E6%89%80%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96URL%E2%80%9D(%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%97%B6%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fathena%2Ffaq%2Findex.html%3Fplat_id%3D7%26amp%3Bid%3D1675539226863629%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F41%2Fdocs%2F1808720563583179%3Forigin%3Dleft_nav%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-W6d0JZnR%5C%22%3E%E5%AF%B9%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%EF%BC%8C%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bvideo_ids%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91ID%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bmaterial_ids%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%EF%BC%88%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90ID%EF%BC%89%E3%80%81%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bsignatures%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E7%9A%84md5%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%89%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-U2AuG7bY%5C%22%3E%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%A8100w%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%85%E6%97%B6%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%85%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Z7Ze9MLM\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lThFLe7e\">为保证接口使用的安全性，避免调取他人的图片信息，该接口针对素材URL的字段仅查询自己主体下的素材才会返回，即需查询的投放账户的主体需与APPID对应开发者的主体保持一致，才可获取到素材的预览URL的信息，否则会提示：“素材所属主体与开发者主体不一致无法获取URL”(第三方获取敏感物料信息可在授权时申请投放账户授权敏感物料权限，可参考常见问题【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/athena/faq/index.html?plat_id=7&amp;id=1675539226863629\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1808720563583179?origin=left_nav\" target=\"_blank\">敏感物料授权</a>】）！</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W6d0JZnR\">对素材视频进行过滤的时候，<code>video_ids</code>（视频ID）、<code>material_ids</code>（素材ID）、<code>signatures</code>（视频的md5值）只能选择一个进行过滤！</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U2AuG7bY\">获取视频素材数据量在100w以内时支持全量获取</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1751529813263372%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22QQqNf%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-h2hO5Kkh\" id=\"h346b9f0-h2hO5Kkh\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-dDJKYDLI\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710601820172\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fWh5M373\" id=\"h346b9f0-fWh5M373\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-7volIDNS\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6bN9IdYK\" id=\"h346b9f0-6bN9IdYK\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-d51zR85e\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-CP7cjSjp\" id=\"h346b9f0-CP7cjSjp\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8FAR3yBB\">客户ID\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Kap9MVr3\">视频过滤条件\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">width</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wqDQgWHY\">视频宽度\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">height</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EfW6H93E\">视频高度\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ratio</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z1nn67pl\">视频宽高比，示例: [1.7, 2.5]\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RICxy6Zq\">输入1.7则搜索满足宽高比介于1.65-1.75之间的视频，即精度上下浮动0.05</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7n2w4FpN\">视频ids，示例: [\"86adb23eaa21229fc04ef932b5089bb8\"]\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5lDirqod\">数量限制：&lt;=100\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cKoKE3dZ\">注意：video_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0EwEa0bo\">素材id列表，可以根据material_ids（素材报表使用的id，一个素材唯一对应一个素材id）进行过滤\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ckej0fYN\">数量限制：&lt;=100\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-mBnTY80V\">注意：video_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">signatures</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XR97wHSB\">md5值列表，可以根据素材的md5进行过滤\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ZrIkr3J\">数量限制：&lt;=100\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z8X820CY\">注意：video_ids、material_ids、signatures只能选择一个进行过滤</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kW8BqEhr\">根据视频上传时间进行过滤的起始时间，与end_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9caiwdQg\">根据视频上传时间进行过滤的截止时间，与start_time搭配使用，格式：yyyy-mm-dd\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">labels</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sAIeLH8B\">视频标签。其中，投放变现方式为仅IAA的素材支持<code>仅IAA</code>筛选。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">source</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VJtOhb2j\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">素材来源，详见</span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-素材来源】</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AMkg92IU\">枚举值大小写敏感，请严格按照定义的名称传参</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_author_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KT0YGQyl\">星图达人 id 检索，仅当source = <code>STAR</code> 时，支持通过星图达人ID进行筛选，单次最多支持传入20 个id进行检索</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TC60UOpZ\">页码，默认值1\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7woLGxVl\">页面大小，默认值20\n</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6GNZ5B3P\" id=\"h346b9f0-6GNZ5B3P\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ffile%2Fvideo%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20width%20%3D%20WIDTH%5Cn%20%20%20%20height%20%3D%20HEIGHT%5Cn%20